{"availability":"available","full":"DartNative/dartnative","name":"dartnative","description":"Native iOS and Android apps from Dart","category":"Other","language":"Dart","stars":195,"forks":6,"created":"2026-09-05T12:23:33Z","updated":"2026-10-06T15:57:06Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://dartpub.dev/framework","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2104834374869094747","postId":"2104834374869094747","postedAt":"2026-09-29T07:23:15.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T10:25:27.372Z","stars":195,"forks":6}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["DartNative is a framework for building iOS and Android applications using Dart — with real, native platform UI instead of a custom rendering engine.","Your Dart code drives UIKit on iOS and the Android View system on Android directly, through synchronous FFI calls on the main thread. There is no JavaScript bridge, no custom rendering engine abstracting system components, no thread hops. What you ship is a native app that happens to be written in Dart: AOT-compiled, full speed from the first frame, the platform's own look and feel, and no custom renderer between your code and the screen.","Flutter proved that a single codebase for mobile could be productive for cross-platform development. But it achieves that by replacing the platform UI stack with its own rendering engine — Impeller / Skia — repainting every pixel of your interface every frame. That design prioritizes multi-platform, pixel-perfect consistency over integration, detaching your app from the operating system it runs on."],"features":["Native controls are replaced by simulated widgets","Text rendering differs from the platform","Scrolling physics feel approximate","Gestures need translation layers","Accessibility and platform behavior require extra work"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DartNative/dartnative/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"367e250404ed9b74b0da57de1965a4ecf471b9ad1fd1aef6ab46bcea6e0310d1","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"DartNative is a framework for building iOS and Android applications using Dart — with real, native platform UI instead of a custom rendering engine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DartNative/dartnative/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"System — storage, push notifications, social sign-in, connectivity, and other device APIs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DartNative/dartnative/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No account or key needed — the playground is an official demo, free to run. dn is the DartNative CLI; see docs/gettingstarted.md to install it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DartNative/dartnative/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"367e250404ed9b74b0da57de1965a4ecf471b9ad1fd1aef6ab46bcea6e0310d1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DartNative/dartnative/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T15:57:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DartNative/dartnative/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:26.972Z","hash":"367e250404ed9b74b0da57de1965a4ecf471b9ad1fd1aef6ab46bcea6e0310d1","originalBytes":17774,"storedBytes":17774,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["dartnative","dart","native","platform","docs","code","flutter","app","every","real","android","text","thread","widget","engine","ffi","playground","state","storage","system","zero","await","final","main","one","same","views","widgets","any","custom","full","ios","rendering","run",